 caravan comes a new wave of intrigue. A pattern of strange coincidences involving the visitors and their wares unsettles Maomao, driving her to investigate the puzzling circumstances behind the convoy. As dangers from both outside and within threaten the balance between the imperial concubines, Maomao continues to utilize her cunning and medical expertise to keep the women safe from harm.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Medicine","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Royal Affairs","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Detective","rank":91,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":89,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Politics","rank":89,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ancient China","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Foreign","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Work","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Conspiracy","rank":85,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Class Struggle","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Espionage","rank":80,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":78,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Educational","rank":71,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aromantic","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Seinen","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Pregnancy","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":63,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":63,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":62,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Survival","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Guns","rank":58,"spoiler":true},{"name":"War","rank":58,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Maids","rank":56,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Chibi","rank":48,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ghost","rank":45,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Animals","rank":42,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crossdressing","rank":39,"spoiler":true},{"name":"LGBTQ+ Themes","rank":38,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Assassins","rank":36,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Desert","rank":33,"spoiler":true},{"name":"S